Bind Npc 31573 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 31574 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 631 "Long-lasting Life"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to the [Staff of Subjugation Squad] Verr."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to the [Staff of Subjugation Squad] Gray."

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 621 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Ver, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad] needs help.  Shall we talk to him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Grey, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad] needs help.  Shall we talk to him?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Good day to you. I am Ver, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad]."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We are currently running a research to find more [effective ways] to reduce the number of Goblins to minimize the number of battles.\n\nThat being said ...Have you ever messed around with food when you were young? I need to ask you a favor in regards to that.\n\nThe of Goblin Karus area near the village of Bell] [Staff Squad, and dialogue."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Good day to you. I am Grey, the [Chief of Subjugation Squad]."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "We are currently running a research to find more [effective ways] to reduce the number of Goblins to minimize the number of battles.\n\nThat being said ...Have you ever messed around with food when you were young? I need to ask you a favor in regards to that.\n\nEl Morad near the villages of the region Goblin gray] [Staff Squad, and need to talk."

On claimable
    Show quest "Good. You sure are full of skills enough to play a [joke]. You need some ingredients to obtain. You need to gather [Oaks Poisonous Weed Bundle] that [Rad Oaks] carry around."
